        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "草高拾四萬五千六百三拾七石八斗壹合（水損地ヲ引去現高也）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "草高 十四万五千六百三十七石八斗一合（水損地を引き去りたる現高なり）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Gross assessed yield (kusadaka): 145,637.801 koku, with the interlinear note that this is the present yield after land damaged by flooding has been deducted. The second interlinear note, five columns further left, gives 149,257.629 koku less 3,620.548 koku; that subtraction reconciles to 145,637 koku in the whole-koku place but yields .081 rather than the printed .801 in the sub-koku places."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "草高"
      }
