  {
    "id": "anno-toyama_upper_p054_left-11",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "婦負郡ノ内錢納草高壹萬四十石貳斗四升貳合ノ内水損變地高百四拾五石壹斗貳升壹合引去高（現高九千八百九十五石一斗一升九合）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "婦負郡のうち銭納草高 一万四十石二斗四升二合、そのうち水損変地高 百四十五石一斗二升一合を引き去りたる高（現高 九千八百九十五石一斗一升九合）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Interlinear note on the cash portion: within Nei district the kusadaka commuted to cash payment is 10,040.242 koku; of that, 145.121 koku of flood-damaged and altered land is deducted, leaving a present yield of 9,895.119 koku. The integers reconcile (10,040 minus 145 = 9,895); the sub-koku places as printed do not (.242 minus .121 = .121, against the printed .119), which is a discrepancy in the source."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "婦負郡錢納高割註"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p054_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
