      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-toyama_upper_p054_left-12",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "（婦負郡一圓三百六十八ヶ村新川郡ノ内百十九ヶ邨草物十四萬九千貳百五十七石六斗貳升九合ノ内水損變地高三千六百廿石五斗四升八合引去本文ノ高也）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（婦負郡一円 三百六十八ヶ村、新川郡のうち百十九ヶ村、草高 十四万九千二百五十七石六斗二升九合、そのうち水損変地高 三千六百二十石五斗四升八合を引き去りたるが本文の高なり）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "(Interlinear note behind the kusadaka: the whole of Nei district, 368 villages, together with 119 villages within Niikawa district, carry a gross assessed yield of 149,257.629 koku; deducting 3,620.548 koku of flood-damaged and altered land gives the figure entered in the main text. The two village counts total 487. The character printed after 草 is 物, not 高 — recorded verbatim here, and read as the compiler's slip for 草高.)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "婦負新川兩郡草物高割註"
      }
    ],
